<title>USA: Madera expects to post profits.</title>
<headline>Madera expects to post profits.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Madera International Inc said on Thursday that it expects to report a profit for the second consecutive quarter, for the fourth quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Madera, a lumber firm that owns 729,000 acres of rainforest in Brazil, said it expects this trend to continue through 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>Madera said it had made two lumber shipments for revenues of $1.03 million during the March quarter.</p>
